    <briefdescription>
<para>DAP stdin reader: background thread that parses Content-Length-framed JSON. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Runs a dedicated thread that reads DAP messages from stdin following the Debug Adapter Protocol wire format (Content-Length header + JSON body). Each parsed message goes to onMessage on the reader thread. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
